	(text "Battery: J2 (pin 1 = +) through F1 2 A PTC to VBAT. Switch: SW1 drives only the Q1 gate; SYS_SW = SYS when on.\n2.2M gate pull-up = off when floating (1.9 uA through the ON switch, was 38 uA with 100k); 10k + 22nF soft-start limits inrush into the Walter bulk caps."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
