	(text "3.3 V always-on rail: TPS62840DLCR buck from SYS_SW, 2.2uH, 10uF in/out. EN from SYS_SW via 100k. VSET 267k = 3.3 V.\nMODE low = power-save (DNP 0R to 3V3 tries forced PWM if the e-ink shows ripple). STOP low. VOS senses 3V3."
